        "text": "GMAT Focus Quant tests arithmetic and algebra with an emphasis on conceptual traps rather than brute computation. In GMAT Coaching Fees in Gurgaon, mastering number properties (primes, divisibility, remainders, even/odd parity) and algebra (inequalities, absolute values, quadratics) is non-negotiable."
